<title>FRANCE: EU rejects bids to export German intervention rye.</title>
<headline>EU rejects bids to export German intervention rye.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday rejected bids to export German intervention rye, EU grain officials said.</p>
<p>Traders had bid to export 76,216 tonnes of German intervention rye to countries outside the EU at today's grain auction, they said.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
